AMI Version 1
    ↓
New OS Patches
    ↓
New AMI Version 2
    ↓
Deploy Version 2
    ↓
Validate
    ↓
Retire Version 1
    ↓
Deregister AMI
    ↓
Delete Associated Snapshots

You should maintain:

Current AMI
Previous AMI
Rollback AMI
AMI retention period
Snapshot retention
AMI ownership
AMI consumers
