OS patching	Manual	SSM Patch Manager
CIS hardening	Manual scripts	Image Builder components
Software installation	Manual	Image Builder/SSM
Security validation	Manual	Automated validation
Vulnerability scanning	Manual	Pipeline-integrated
AMI creation	Manual	Image Builder
AMI naming	Manual	Automated versioning
AMI publishing	Manual	Automated
Terraform update	Manual	Pipeline-driven
EC2 deployment	Manual	Terraform
Compliance	Periodic	Continuous
AMI retirement	Manual	Automated lifecycle
Rollback	Manual	Previous AMI version
