The key platform principle

The future state should be:

Git → CI/CD → Image Builder → Harden → Patch → Scan → Validate → Approve → Golden AMI → Terraform → EC2 → Monitor → Compliance → Rebuild

rather than:

Engineer → Launch EC2 → Manually patch → Manually harden → Install software → Create AMI → Copy AMI → Deploy
